tinacloud-auth(1) -- Authenticate with TinaCloud
================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud auth` <command>

## DESCRIPTION

Manage TinaCloud authentication for the current user.

## COMMANDS

  * `login`:
    Sign in through a browser.

  * `logout`:
    Remove locally cached credentials.

  * `status`:
    Display the current authentication status.

## EXAMPLES

Sign in, then confirm the active account:

	$ tinacloud auth login
	$ tinacloud auth status

Sign out on a shared machine:

	$ tinacloud auth logout

